<mxCell id="scope" value="Selected members; StoreCouponsController uses JwtAuthGuard then RolesGuard. @Roles(...roles) is a metadata decorator function, not a class. RolesGuard implements CanActivate and reads request.user; Passport links JwtAuthGuard to JwtStrategy. Framework bases, cache and coupon business models are omitted; see FR02_CODE_ANALYSIS.md." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="2150" width="2500" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>